---
---
<section class="mt-4.5 bg-[#0a0912]/90 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-md p-5 sm:p-7" id="projects" aria-label="Featured projects">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-end gap-4 flex-wrap mb-5">
    <div>
      <div class="font-mono-code text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-[#ffb347]">
        <span class="i18n-en">Featured work</span>
        <span class="i18n-th">ผลงานคัดสรร</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mt-1.5 text-white">
        <span class="i18n-en">Projects</span>
        <span class="i18n-th">โปรเจกต์</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#c9c2dc] max-w-[520px] m-0">
      <span class="i18n-en">Ordered by weight: real client work → startup → large systems → strong coursework → creative coding. All details are from verified repos.</span>
      <span class="i18n-th">เรียงตามน้ำหนัก: งานลูกค้าจริง → สตาร์ทอัพ → ระบบขนาดใหญ่ → ผลงานเรียนดีเด่น → งานเชิงสร้างสรรค์ ข้อมูลตรวจสอบจากโค้ดจริง</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
    <!-- AMPH featured -->
    <article class="md:col-span-2 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ff8a3c]/15 via-[#7c5cff]/15 to-white/5 border border-white/20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-5.5">
      <div class="flex-1 lg:basis-[60%] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono-code text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#ffb347]">
              <span class="i18n-en">Client Work · Live</span>
              <span class="i18n-th">งานลูกค้าจริง · ออนไลน์แล้ว</span>
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono-code text-xs text-[#c9c2dc]">2026</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="i18n-en font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mt-2">
            AMPH — Musician &amp; Crew Catalog
          </h3>
          <h3 class="i18n-th font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mt-2">
            AMPH — ดนตรี &amp; บุคลากร
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#c9c2dc] leading-relaxed mt-2">
            <span class="i18n-en">A live catalog and booking platform connecting event organizers with musicians, producers and production crews — searchable profiles, with every booking conversation handing off to LINE.</span>
            <span class="i18n-th">แพลตฟอร์มแคตตาล็อกและระบบติดต่อจองตัวนักดนตรี โปรดิวเซอร์ และทีมงานโปรดักชัน สำหรับผู้จัดอีเวนต์ พร้อมระบบค้นหาโปรไฟล์และการส่งต่องานต่อไปยัง LINE อัตโนมัติ</span>
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">pnpm</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Vinext</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Vinext Cloudflare</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Vite</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">React</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">React Server Components</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Tailwind CSS</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Radix UI</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">React Hook Form</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Zod</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Sonner</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">nuqs</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Fontsource Prompt</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Supabase</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Hono</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Hono Zod OpenAPI</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Swagger UI</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Cloudflare Workers</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Wrangler</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/30 text-[#efeaff]">Cloudflare R2</span>
